# Build outputs (WinUI / .NET generate hundreds of MB under bin & obj).
**/bin/
**/obj/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# WiX intermediate symbol file.
*.wixpdb

# Publish payload: the loose self-contained runtime folder is reproducible with
